+// ValidSubmodulePath applies ValidTreePath and the rule a submodule
+// path needs beyond it: no NTFS or HFS+ spelling of "." or "..".
+// Submodule.Repository chroots the submodule worktree to this path, so
+// such a component scopes the submodule to the superproject worktree
+// root instead of a directory below it, and a checkout then
+// materialises the submodule's blobs over the superproject's own
+// files.
